    "mcp_tool_description": "Create or update a parameter (CustomField) and attach it to environments or groups with options and constraints, as the Parameters admin page and an environment's Parameters tab do. onb_param_name is the internal name (application_tier, cost_center, expiration_date, power_schedule); a new parameter gets onb_param_type (STR default; INT, DEC, BOOL, TXT, DT for a date) and onb_param_label. onb_param_targets lists ENV- or GRP- ids or names, one per line; onb_param_options the choices to offer there, one per line; onb_param_max and onb_param_min constrain numbers, or days from today for a date (expiration_date with onb_param_max=30 caps leases at 30 days). onb_param_required true makes it mandatory on those targets. Test plan 1.1.2, 2.5.1, 3.1.1, 3.1.2. Requires a CloudBolt admin caller.",
    "mcp_tool_name": "onb_parameter",
    "mcp_tool_title": ""
